{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16217060","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16217060","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1621706001:0":{"text":"풍향계가 멈췄어. 강한 마법 파동을 지닌 물건이 이 근처에 있는 게 분명해.","source_cn":"风向标停下来了，带有强烈魔法波动的物品应该就在附近。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC22C64D53613EBF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1621706002:0":{"text":"음... 이 가게에는 진열된 물건이 너무 많아. 어떤 걸까?","source_cn":"唔……这家商店展览着好多东西，会是哪个呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B32D9419984F77F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:3:1621706003:0":{"text":"세이린은 마법 풍향계를 들고 여러 물건에 가까이 다가가 하나하나 세심하게 살폈다","source_cn":"赛琳举着魔法风向标靠近一众商品，仔细地逐个辨别","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B762DD221C03A5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:4:1621706004:0":{"text":"그리고 마침내, 어느 골동품 거울 앞에 멈춰 섰다...","source_cn":"最终，她停在了一面古董镜前……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57A98DFA4A699DEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1621706005:1":{"text":"꼼꼼하게 판단하고 감별한 결과! 이 골동품 거울은... 마법 성물이 맞아!","source_cn":"经过严谨的辨别和判断，我认为……这面古董镜，是一件神奇物品！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46F17C45310DFDCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:5::2":{"text":"골동품 거울","source_cn":"古董镜","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44AD45114CC05974","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1621706006:0":{"text":"그냥 평범한 낡은 거울 같은데...","source_cn":"我怎么感觉这只是一面普通的旧镜子……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x58F6748B62C2B477","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그냥 평범한 낡은 거울 같은데...","female":"그냥 평범한 낡은 거울 같은데...","variant_male_record_index":"207342","variant_female_record_index":"207343","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1621706007:0":{"text":"흠집이 꽤 많긴 하네. 이건 진짜 골동품인 걸까, 아니면 일부러 낡아 보이게 만든 걸까?","source_cn":"上面确实有挺多划痕的。这是真的古董，还是故意做旧的啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36F14E2450578972","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1621706008:1":{"text":"모르겠어. 더 가까이 가서 보자...","source_cn":"不确定，得再离近点看看……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2532E7AEC58AF830","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1621706009:0":{"text":"하하하, 손님 여러분 안목이 정말 대단하시네요!","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈，各位客人的眼光可真不错啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF854EA2497A1417","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_t